<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Adventure Gaming World</title>
</head>

<body>

    <center>

        <h1>Welcome to Adventure Gaming World!</h1>

        <h2>Ready for an Exciting Gaming Challenge?</h2>

        <p>
            Test your gaming skills, overcome obstacles, and enjoy
            playing directly inside this webpage.
        </p>

        <iframe
            src="https://scratch.mit.edu/projects/60917032/embed"
            title="Scratch Adventure Game"
            allowtransparency="true"
            width="600"
            height="450"
            frameborder="0"
            scrolling="no"
            allowfullscreen>
        </iframe>

        <h2>Let the Adventure Begin!</h2>

        <p>
            We used the iframe tag to embed a Scratch game
            into our HTML webpage without opening another tab.
        </p>

    </center>

</body>

</html>
